# .cursor Infrastructure Index

> This file is the single discovery point for all rules, skills, commands, and agents.

## Rules (always-on)

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `rules/00-orchestrator.md` | Core orchestrator behavior: GSD path then RALF path, state management, subagent spawning |
| `rules/10-gsd-spec.md` | GSD spec-first workflow: PRD, Plan, and TASKS.yaml quality bars |
| `rules/20-ralf-execution.md` | RALF execution loop: implement, verify, review, iterate with logging |
| `rules/30-cli-and-gates.md` | CLI subagent constraints (non-interactive) and default gate commands |
| `rules/planning_directive.mdc` | Iterative planning protocol: audit, plan, self-critique, question, refine |
| `rules/github_workflow.mdc` | GitHub push/PR/CI verification protocol |

## Skills (load on demand)

| Skill | File | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| council | `skills/council/SKILL.md` | Triad reasoning: Analyst (exploit), Challenger (critique), Explorer (explore) |
| cursor-cli | `skills/cursor-cli/SKILL.md` | Non-interactive CLI subagent rules: output discipline, error reporting |
| gsd | `skills/gsd/SKILL.md` | Spec-first workflow: onboard, PRD, plan, task DAG |
| prompt-engineer | `skills/prompt-engineer/SKILL.md` | High-fidelity subagent prompt construction |
| ralf | `skills/ralf/SKILL.md` | Implementation loop with gates, memory, and architecture drift detection |
| experiment-loop | `skills/experiment-loop/SKILL.md` | Autonomous experimentation: hypothesis, execute, analyze, iterate |
| frontend-design | `skills/frontend-design/skill.md` | Distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality |

