| `/experiment` | `commands/experiment.md` | Autonomous experimentation loop: hypothesize, execute, analyze, iterate |

## Agents (subagent personas)

| Agent | File | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| implementer | `agents/implementer.md` | Implements a single task with minimal diff |
| verifier | `agents/verifier.md` | Runs gates and reports failures precisely |
| reviewer | `agents/reviewer.md` | Semantic review against PRD and acceptance criteria |
| challenger | `agents/challenger.md` | Challenges assumptions, finds failure modes |
| explorer | `agents/explorer.md` | Generates alternative approaches including non-obvious ones |
| researcher | `agents/researcher.md` | Gathers information via code search and web; produces RESEARCH.md |

## State Layout

| Directory | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `state/gsd/` | PRD, plan, task graph, research results |
| `state/ralf/` | Execution logs, gates, memory, ship summary |
| `state/ralf/logs/T###/` | Per-task logs: prompt, output, exit code, notes |
| `state/experiments/` | Experiment journal, hypotheses, status, output notebooks |

